<body>
    <h1>Maintenance</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"Maintenance-AuthorizationDataUpload">Authorization Data U=
pload</h1>
<h2 id=3D"Maintenance-SystemTool">System Tool</h2>
<p>The system tool will be a resource available on Compass-X for authorized=
 users to upload authorization data and mapping.</p>
<h3 id=3D"Maintenance-RequestUpload">Request Upload</h3>
<p>Authorized user will upload the request in the following format</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
  <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"bru=
sh: js; gutter: false">[
  {
    "targetUrl":"/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/permissions/edit_orde=
r",
=09"httpMethod": "PATCH",
    "payload": { "active": true }
  },
  {
=09"targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/permissions/allocate"=
,
=09"httpMethod": "PATCH",
 &nbsp; &nbsp;"payload": { "active": true }
  }
]

</pre>
 </div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"Maintenance-ResponseDownload">Response Download</h3>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
  <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"bru=
sh: js; gutter: false">[
  { &nbsp; &nbsp;=20
=09"targetUrl":"/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/permissions/edit_order=
",
=09"httpMethod": "PATCH",
 &nbsp; &nbsp;"payload": {"active": true},
    "response": {
      "http-code": 200,
      "description": "{'result': 'success'}"
    }
  }, &nbsp; {
=09"targetUrl":"/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/permissions/allocate",
=09"httpMethod": "PATCH",
 &nbsp; &nbsp;"payload": { "active": true },
 =09"response": {
      "http-code": 200,
      "description": "{'result': 'success'}"
    }
  }
]</pre>
 </div>
</div>
