<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Maintenance-JSONFormat">JSON Format<=
/h2>
<p class=3D"auto-cursor-target">The following JSON format templates are pro=
vided for different scenarios when using the system tool.</p>
<h3 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Maintenance-JSONformatforcreationfro=
mcapabilitytofeaturepackagetemplate">JSON format for creation from capabili=
ty to feature package template</h3>
<p>The following order of execution must be provided for a creation request=
:</p>
<ol>
 <li>Creating a capability</li>
 <li>Creating roles under a capability</li>
 <li>Creating permissions under a capability</li>
 <li>Creating user groups</li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Adding permissions for a role under a c=
apability</span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Creating resources under a capability</=
span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Adding a user group and role assignment=
s</span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Creating a feature package template wit=
h user groups and/or resources</span></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom">
  <b class=3D"code-title"></b><span class=3D"collapse-source expand-control=
" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-control-icon icon">&nbsp;</=
span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source</span></span><span c=
lass=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
  <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"bru=
sh: js; gutter: false; collapse: true">[
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "demo",
            "description": "Demo for IAM Sys Tool",
            "lob": 6588
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/roles",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "roleName": "wealth:demo:reader",
            "capability": "demo"
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/roles",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "roleName": "wealth:demo:editor",
            "capability": "demo"
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/permissions",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "demo:reader",
            "capability": "demo",
            "description": "Permission to read data",
            "isActive": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/permissions",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "demo:editor",
            "capability": "demo",
            "description": "Permission to update data",
            "isActive": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/groups",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "Wealth:CompassX:Demo",
            "description": "Demo User Group",
            "isInternal": false,
            "isFirmScope": false,
            "isActive": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/roles/wealth:de=
mo:reader/assignments/permission",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": [
            "demo:reader"
        ]
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/demo/roles/wealth:de=
mo:editor/assignments/permission",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": [
            "demo:reader",
            "demo:editor"
        ]
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/resources/demo_resource_type",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "resource_type": "demo_resource_type",
            "name": "demo_resource",
            "groupName": "demo_type",
            "description": "demo_type",
            "confUri": "nbin.wealth-tu.apis.bnc.ca",
            "version": "v1.0",
            "active": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/groups/Wealth:CompassX:Demo/assig=
nments/role",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": [
            "wealth:demo:reader",
            "wealth:demo:editor"
        ]
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/features/packages/template",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "DemoPkg",
            "description": "DemoPkg",
            "type": "User",
            "firmType": "IB",
            "active": true,
            "details": [
                {
                    "assignmentType": "G",
                    "assignmentMode": "M",
                    "selectionDefault": true,
                    "assignee": "Wealth:CompassX:Demo"
                },
                {
                    "assignmentType": "S",
                    "assignmentMode": "M",
                    "selectionDefault": true,
                    "assignee": "demo_resource"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
] &nbsp;</pre>
 </div>
</div>
<h3 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Maintenance-JSONformatforadding/upda=
tingaresource">JSON format for adding/updating a resource</h3>
<p>The following order of execution must be provided for an upsert request:=
</p>
<ol>
 <li>Creating permissions under a capability</li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Adding permissions for a role under a c=
apability</span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Creating resources under a capability</=
span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Creating a feature package template wit=
h newly created resources</span></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom">
  <b class=3D"code-title"></b><span class=3D"collapse-source expand-control=
" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-control-icon icon">&nbsp;</=
span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source</span></span><span c=
lass=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
  <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"bru=
sh: js; gutter: false; collapse: true">[
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/aom/permissions",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "aom:access-account",
            "capability": "aom",
            "description": "Access self account",
            "isActive": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/permissions",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "name": "moe:view_position",
            "capability": "moe",
            "description": "Access self position",
            "isActive": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/aom/roles/wealth:aom=
:editor/assignments/permission",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": [
            "aom:access-account"
        ]
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/capabilities/moe/roles/wealth:moe=
:viewer/assignments/permission",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": [
            "moe:view_position"
        ]
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/resources/page",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "resource_type": "page",
            "name": "view-manage-firm",
            "groupName": "fum:manage",
            "description": "View Manage Firm",
            "confUri": "nbin.wealth-tu.apis.bnc.ca",
            "version": "v1.0",
            "active": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/resources/access",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "resource_type": "access",
            "name": "view-all-firms",
            "groupName": "fum:manage",
            "description": "View all firms",
            "confUri": "nbin.wealth-tu.apis.bnc.ca",
            "version": "v1.1",
            "active": true
        }
    },
    {
        "targetUrl": "/iam/access-control/resources/module",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "payload": {
            "resource_type": "module",
            "name": "view-firm-configuration",
            "groupName": "fum:manage",
            "description": "View Firm Configuration",
            "confUri": "nbin.wealth-tu.apis.bnc.ca",
            "version": "v1.2",
