<h3 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Maintenance-JSONformatfordeletingare=
source">JSON format for deleting a resource</h3>
<p>The following order of execution must be provided for a delete request:<=
/p>
<ol>
 <li>Delete role permission assignments under a <span style=3D"color:#172b4=
d;">capability</span></li>
 <li>Delete permissions under a <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">capability</=
span></li>
 <li>Delete resources</li>
 <li>Delete feature package templates</li>
</ol>
